" alt=\"\"></span>\n      <span data-tag=\"OBJ_07  KIMI K3.1 PRO  ELO 1663\"></span></p></div><div tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"GPT-6 Astra: Elo rating 1638, 8th of 17\" data-name=\"GPT-6 Astra\" data-score=\"1638\" data-ps=\"64.17\">\n      <p><span><img src=\"https://frontierdesign.contralabs.com/frontierdesign/logos/gpt.svg?h=106c63cdf0\" alt=\"\"></span>\n      <span data-tag=\"OBJ_08  GPT-6 ASTRA  ELO 1638\"></span></p></div><div tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Qwen3.8 Max: Elo rating 1434, 9th of 17\" data-name=\"Qwen3.8 Max\" data-score=\"1434\" data-ps=\"46.43\">\n      <p><span><img src=\"https://frontierdesign.contralabs.com/frontierdesign/logos/qwen-color.svg?h=e431e746a0\" alt=\"\"></span>\n      <span data-tag=\"OBJ_09  QWEN3.8 MAX  ELO 1434\"></span></p></div><div tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Kimi K3: Elo rating 1415, 10th of 17\" data-name=\"Kimi K3\" data-score=\"1415\" data-ps=\"44.78\">\n      <p><span><img src=\"https://frontierdesign.contralabs.com/frontierdesign/logos/kimi-color.svg?h=c149793bb7\" alt=\"\"></span>\n      <span data-tag=\"OBJ_10  KIMI K3  ELO 1415\"></span></p></div><div tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"GLM-5.3 Prime: Elo rating 1403, 11th of 17\" data-name=\"GLM-5.3 Prime\" data-score=\"1403\" data-ps=\"43.74\">\n      <p><span><img src=\"https://frontierdesign.contralabs.com/frontierdesign/logos/zai.svg?h=4a567c6c74\" alt=\"\"></span>\n      <span data-tag=\"OBJ_11  GLM-5.3 PRIME  ELO 1403\"></span></p></div><div tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Gemini 4 Carbon: Elo rating 1366, 12th of 17\" data-name=\"Gemini 4 Carbon\" data-score=\"1366\" data-ps=\"40.52\">\n      <p><span><img src=\"https://frontierdesign.contralabs.com/frontierdesign/logos/gemini-color.svg?h=81ca7ec1b9\" alt=\"\"></span>\n      <span data-tag=\"OBJ_12  GEMINI 4 CARBON  ELO 1366\"></span></p></div><div tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Muse Spark 1.3: Elo rating 1335, 13th of 17\" data-name=\"Muse Spark 1.3\" data-score=\"1335\" data-ps=\"37.83\">\n      <p><span><img src=\"https://frontierdesign.contralabs.com/frontierdesign/logos/meta-color.svg?h=9380e201a1\" alt=\"\"></span>\n      <span data-tag=\"OBJ_13  MUSE SPARK 1.3  ELO 1335\"></span></p></div><div tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Muse Wonder: Elo rating 1249, 14th of 17\" data-name=\"Muse Wonder\" data-score=\"1249\" data-ps=\"30.35\">\n      <p><span><img src=\"https://frontierdesign.contralabs.com/frontierdesign/logos/meta-color.svg?h=9380e201a1\" alt=\"\"></span>\n      <span data-tag=\"OBJ_14  MUSE WONDER  ELO 1249\"></span></p></div><div tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Grok 4.7: Elo rating 1247, 15th of 17\" data-name=\"Grok 4.7\" data-score=\"1247\" data-ps=\"30.17\">\n      <p><span><img src=\"https://frontierdesign.contralabs.com/frontierdesign/logos/xai.svg?h=95f6be3d8b\" alt=\"\"></span>\n      <span data-tag=\"OBJ_15  GROK 4.7  ELO 1247\"></span></p></div><div tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Gemini 4 Argon: Elo rating 1221, 16th of 17\" data-name=\"Gemini 4 Argon\" data-score=\"1221\" data-ps=\"27.91\">\n      <p><span><img src=\"https://frontierdesign.contralabs.com/frontierdesign/logos/gemini-color.svg?h=81ca7ec1b9\" alt=\"\"></span>\n      <span data-tag=\"OBJ_16  GEMINI 4 ARGON  ELO 1221\"></span></p></div><div tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"DeepSeek V4 Pro: Elo rating 1121, 17th of 17\" data-name=\"DeepSeek V4 Pro\" data-score=\"1121\" data-ps=\"19.22\">\n      <p><span><img src=\"https://frontierdesign.contralabs.com/frontierdesign/logos/deepseek-color.svg?h=36f326d524\" alt=\"\"></span>\n      <span data-tag=\"OBJ_17  DEEPSEEK V4 PRO  ELO 1121\"></span></p></div>\n  </div>\n  <ol><li>Gestalt</li><li>Human designers</li><li>Claude Fable 5.2</li><li>Claude Opus 5.5</li><li>GPT-6.1 Sol</li><li>Claude Sonnet 5.5</li><li>Kimi K3.1 Pro</li><li>GPT-6 Astra</li><li>Qwen3.8 Max</li><li>Kimi K3</li><li>GLM-5.3 Prime</li><li>Gemini 4 Carbon</li><li>Muse Spark 1.3</li><li>Muse Wonder</li><li>Grok 4.7</li><li>Gemini 4 Argon</li><li>DeepSeek V4 Pro</li></ol>\n<p><span>contralabs.com/frontierdesign</span></p></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n      <div>\n        \n        <h2 data-mark=\"judged by designers | scored by rubrics\">Real&#160;design projects, judged by&#160;designers and scored by&#160;rubrics</h2>\n        <p>Frontier&#160;Design Benchmark is&#160;the first benchmark built on&#160;real world, high value, and complex design projects. It&#160;is judged by&#160;professional designers in&#160;the Contra Labs network, ensuring the quality of&#160;evaluation.</p>\n        <p>In&#160;the benchmark, we&#160;also built a&#160;design critique rubric and a&#160;list of AI&#160;slop patterns. The&#160;rubric scores are highly correlated with the designers’ ratings of&#160;the models (r = 0.94). These&#160;additional metrics provide explainable design quality judgement on&#160;top of pairwise&#160;preferences.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        \n        <dl>\n          <P><dt>33</dt><dd>design&#160;briefs</dd></P>\n          <P><dt>68</dt><dd>contributing&#160;designers</dd></P>\n          <P><dt>4,311</dt><dd>blind&#160;votes</dd></P>\n          <P><dt>35</dt><dd>rubric&#160;dimensions</dd></P>\n        </dl>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div>\n        <div><h2 data-mark=\"Gallery\">Golden&#160;Gallery</h2><p>Real&#160;client briefs, each with its golden: the design set beside the models’ outputs as the&#160;bar.</p></div>\n        <p><a href=\"gallery\">View&#160;all</a>\n      </p></div>\n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n  </main>\n</div>\n\n<header><span><a data-auth=\"in\" href=\"/frontierdesign/api/auth/login?next=%2Ffrontierdesign\"><span>Sign in</span></a><a href=\"https://calendly.com/partnerships-contra/contra-labs-partnership-request\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Get in touch</span></a></span></header><nav aria-label=\"Site\"><ul><li><a href=\".\" aria-current=\"page\"><span>Home</span></a></li><li><a href=\"gallery\"><span>Gallery</span><em>[12]</em></a></li><li><a href=\"leaderboard\"><span>Leaderboard</span></a></li></ul>\n\n\n</nav></div><template id=\"page-src\">\n<div>\n  <main>\n    \n\n    <section id=\"hero\">\n      \n      <div>\n          <h1><span>Deconstructing</span> <span>Real World Creativity.</span></h1>\n          <p>Exploring the frontier of AI design capabilities through real client briefs from Contra’s marketplace, golden designs and model comparisons.</p>\n        </div>\n      <p><span data-typo=\"off\">© 2026 Contra&#160;Labs&#160;×&#160;<a data-link=\"benchflow\" href=\"https://benchflow.ai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BenchFlow</a></span></p>\n    </section>\n\n    <div>\n        <div><h2 data-mark=\"Leaderboard\">Leaderboard</h2><p>How frontier models rank in blind head-to-head votes on real client briefs from Contra’s marketplace.</p></div>\n        <div><p><a href=\"methodology\">Methodology</a><a href=\"leaderboard\">Full leaderboard</a></p></div>\n      </div>\n\n    <section>\n      <div>\n        <div>\n          <p><a href=\"gallery\">Explore gallery</a>\n          <a data-link=\"blog\" href=\"blog\">Read the blog</a>\n        </p></div>\n        <h2 data-mark=\"judged by designers | scored by rubrics\">Real design projects, judged by designers and scored by rubrics</h2>\n        <p>Frontier Design Benchmark is the first benchmark built on real world, high value, and complex design projects. It is judged by professional designers in the Contra Labs network, ensuring the quality of evaluation.</p>\n        <p>In the benchmark, we also built a design critique rubric and a list of AI slop patterns. The rubric scores are highly correlated with the designers’ ratings of the models (r = 0.94). These additional metrics provide explainable design quality judgement on top of pairwise preferences.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        \n        <dl>\n          <P><dt>33</dt><dd>design briefs</dd></P>\n          <P><dt>68</dt><dd>contributing designers</dd></P>\n          <P><dt>4,311</dt><dd>blind votes</dd></P>\n          <P><dt>35</dt><dd>rubric dimensions</dd></P>\n        </dl>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div>\n        <div><h2 data-mark=\"Gallery\">Golden Gallery</h2><p>Real client briefs, each with its golden: the design set beside the models’ outputs as the bar.</p></div>\n        <p><a href=\"gallery\">View all</a>\n      </p></div>\n\n    <div id=\"research\">\n        \n        <h2 data-mark=\"research\">Read the research</h2>\n        <div>\n          <a data-link=\"blog\" href=\"blog\">\n            <span><span>Blog</span><span></span></span>\n            <div><P><h3>Frontier Design: Evaluating AI on Real World Design Tasks</h3></P><p><span>Read the blog</span></p></div>\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"methodology\">\n            <span><span>Methodology</span><span></span></span>\n            <div><P><h3>How design jobs are set, reviewed, and evaluated</h3></P><p><span>Methodology</span></p></div>\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"rubric\">\n            <span><span>Rubric</span><span></span></span>\n            <div><P><h3>Pairwise, design rubrics, and AI slop patterns</h3></P><p><span>View the rubric</span></p></div>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    \n\n    <footer></footer>\n  </main>\n</div></template>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"Home Deconstructing Real World Creativity. Exploring the frontier of AI design capabilities through real client briefs from Contra’s marketplace, golden designs and model comparisons. © 2026 Contra Labs × BenchFlow LeaderboardHow frontier models rank in blind head-to-head votes on real client briefs from Contra’s marketplace. FrontierDesign Benchmark Elo rating from blind head-to-head votes GestaltHuman designersClaude Fable 5.2Claude Opus 5.5GPT-6.1 SolClaude Sonnet 5.5Kimi K3.1 ProGPT-6 AstraQwen3.8 MaxKimi K3GLM-5.3 PrimeGemini 4 CarbonMuse Spark 1.3Muse WonderGrok 4.7Gemini 4 ArgonDeepSeek V4 Pro contralabs.com/frontierdesign Real design projects, judged by designers and scored by rubrics Frontier Design Benchmark is the first benchmark built on real world, high value, and complex design projects. It is judged by professional designers in the Contra Labs network, ensuring the quality of evaluation. In the benchmark, we also built a design critique rubric and a list of AI slop patterns. The rubric scores are highly correlated with the designers’ ratings of the models (r = 0.94). These additional metrics provide explainable design quality judgement on top of pairwise preferences. 33design briefs 68contributing designers 4,311blind votes 35rubric dimensions Golden GalleryReal client briefs, each with its golden: the design set beside the models’ outputs as the bar. View all Sign inGet in touchHomeGallery[12]Leaderboard Deconstructing Real World Creativity. Exploring the frontier of AI design capabilities through real client briefs from Contra’s marketplace, golden designs and model comparisons. © 2026 Contra Labs × BenchFlow LeaderboardHow frontier models rank in blind head-to-head votes on real client briefs from Contra’s marketplace. MethodologyFull leaderboard Explore gallery Read the blog Real design projects, judged by designers and scored by rubrics Frontier Design Benchmark is the first benchmark built on real world, high value, and complex design projects. It is judged by professional designers in the Contra Labs network, ensuring the quality of evaluation. In the benchmark, we also built a design critique rubric and a list of AI slop patterns. The rubric scores are highly correlated with the designers’ ratings of the models (r = 0.94). These additional metrics provide explainable design quality judgement on top of pairwise preferences. 33design briefs 68contributing designers 4,311blind votes 35rubric dimensions Golden GalleryReal client briefs, each with its golden: the design set beside the models’ outputs as the bar. View all Read the research Blog Frontier Design: Evaluating AI on Real World Design TasksRead the blog Methodology How design jobs are set