    <div>\n          <a data-link=\"blog\" href=\"blog\">\n            <span><span>Blog</span><span></span></span>\n            <div><p></p><h3>Frontier Design: Evaluating AI on Real World Design Tasks</h3><p></p><p><span>Read the blog</span></p></div>\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"methodology\">\n            <span><span>Methodology</span><span></span></span>\n            <div><p></p><h3>How design jobs are set, reviewed, and evaluated</h3><p></p><p><span>Methodology</span></p></div>\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"rubric\">\n            <span><span>Rubric</span><span></span></span>\n            <div><p></p><h3>Pairwise, design rubrics, and AI slop patterns</h3><p></p><p><span>View the rubric</span></p></div>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    \n\n    <footer></footer>\n  </main>\n</div></template>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div></div>"}